          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.15+1KI.7.16+1KI.7.17+1KI.7.18+1KI.7.19+1KI.7.20+1KI.7.21+1KI.7.22+1KI.7.23+1KI.7.24+1KI.7.25+1KI.7.26+1KI.7.27+1KI.7.28+1KI.7.29+1KI.7.30+1KI.7.31+1KI.7.32+1KI.7.33+1KI.7.34+1KI.7.35+1KI.7.36+1KI.7.37+1KI.7.38+1KI.7.39+1KI.7.40+1KI.7.41+1KI.7.42+1KI.7.43+1KI.7.44+1KI.7.45+1KI.7.46+1KI.7.47"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bab. 7.15-47",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bababiloni bafunaka chinjeko che kumukasa chichaba mu Lukaangu, ne biteetwe bie kimikasa kikiama mu nyanja kikiaba munju ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi batanya mu bitonyi mala basuta kumukasa kwoosi bayila e Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babukula akhaba ne chinyuungu ne chimbako na buano ne chinjelo ne bibuumba bie biiunya bulayi, ne bibiindu bioosi bie kumukasa nibio bakholelanga kimilimo mu Lukaangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babukula akhaba bibuumba bikeekhe ne bifuria ne chinjelo ne chinyuungu, ne biteetwe bie chitaa ne bibuumba bie khurakho biiunya bulayi ne bibuumba bie khusutilakho kamalasile ke khuosia. Omunamane omukhulu abukula buli sisiindu sie sahabu nga esahabu ne sie fwesa nga efwesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne chinjeko chibili che kumukasa, ne nyanja eyekhala khu uunwa ekhumi na chibili che kumukasa ne biteetwe bie kumukasa bisutibwa, nibio omwami Solomoni akhola khulwe Lukaangu, kumukasa kwe bibiindu bino bioosi kwaba kumusiro lukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne chinjeko chibili echo chaba chindekhaane, buli ndala yaba buleeyi chimita munaane khucha angaaki ne khubotookhelesia chimita chiraano ne bitonyi bitaru ne buboofu chimilimita ekhumi na chiraano. Chinjeko chaba chayikukha ekhoombe mukari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli enjeko yaba ne siukutwa sie kumukasa, buleeyi bwe siukutwa bwaba chimita chibili ne bitonyi bibili, biukutwa bino biaba biaronwa ne bifwaani bie bibiaamo bie kamakomanga, ke kumukasa, kumukasa kwaba kwafuuma khu biukutwa khwoosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biabao bifwaani bie bibiaamo bie kamakomanga kamakhumi tisa ne bifwaani sita chimbeka choosi bibiabonekha ne wimile asi ne buli enjeko yaba ne bifwaani bie bibiaamo emia ndala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Babaandu ba Yuda bayilwa e Babiloni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebusaratani omunamae omukhulu abukula Seraya Omusaayi Omukhulu Lukali ne Sefania omusaayi oloondela omukhulu, ne baliindi be kumuliango bataru acha nabo ne bali baboe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khu barama mu lukoba abukula omunamae ne basaakhulu saba khu be kumuse kwo mwami babanyolekha mu lukoba, no muandiki owa komanda owe banamae owaandikanga babaandu be mu sibala ne babaandu kamakhumi sita khu baandu be mu sibala, babanyolekha mu lukoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala Nebusaratani omunamae omukhulu abaamba abareera khu Nebukadinesa omwami owa Babiloni e Ribula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omwami Nebukadinesa abapa abeerera e Ribula mu sibala sia Hamasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Yuda aambwa auyisibwa arusibwa mu sibala siewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bano nibo baboe nibo Nebukadinesa abukula. Mu mwiiko kwewe kukhola saba abukula Bayaudi chielefu chitaru ne kamakhumi kabili na bataru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwiiko kwewe kwe khumi na munaane abukula baboe mia naane salasina mbili khukhwama mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mu mwiiko kwewe kwe kamakhumi kabili na kitaru Nebusaratani omunamae wewe abukula baboe mia saba arubaina tano babaandu boosi alala ba babukulwa baba chielefu chine ne chimia sita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mu mwiiko kwe kamakhumi kataru na saba kwe khuuyisibwa khwa Yehoyakini omwami owa Yuda, mu mwesi kukhola ekhumi na kibili khu ndaalo eye kamakhumi kabili na chiraano mu mwiiko nikwo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebilimerodaki amiisibwakho aba omwami owa Babiloni arusia Yehoyakini omwami owa Yuda mu siboe mala alomaloma ne naye bulayi mala amuelesia endebe eye lukoosi ekhila chindebe che babaami babaandi nibo aba nabo mu Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Yehoyakini afukiililwa khufuula chingubo che mu siboe. Mala khulwe bulamu bwewe bwoosi bubwaba ne buramire, alichanga buli lwosi khu sialwa sio mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 52:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli endaalo, omwami owa Babiloni aelesia Yehoyakini chirupia che khurumikhira khuloondekhana ne lilienya lia Yehoyakini khukhwola endaalo eye lifwa liewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.52.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.52.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
